<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" http-equiv="Content-Type" />
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Reset your RMJobsites password</h1>

  <p>Hi<%= " #{@user.given_name}" if @user.given_name.present? %>,</p>

  <p>We received a request to set or reset the password on your RMJobsites account. Click the link below to choose a new password. The link expires in 15 minutes.</p>

  <p><a href="<%= @reset_url %>"><%= @reset_url %></a></p>

  <p>If you did not request this, you can safely ignore this email.</p>

  <hr>
  <p><em>RM Jobsite Solutions</em></p>
</body>
</html>
